Id: print003w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_printers
Fix: Take the password out of the DeviceURI, or chmod 600 printers.conf.
References: cupsd.conf(5)
Controls: CIS 3.3, 5.2; NIST AC-3, IA-5(7); ISO 5.17, 8.3; CE User access control

A printer URI carries a password, and anyone can read it. Take
the passwords out of the device URIs, or the file out of the
world's sight.
